            <p class="mb-4 text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400"></p>
            <p class="mb-2 text-lg font-medium text-gray-900 dark:text-white">Key Takeaways:</p>
            <ul class="mb-4 list-disc space-y-3 pl-4 text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">
